// Placeholder compositor — passes the field's colour straight through at
// full opacity, with no shape mask. Not real shape logic: the orb's sphere
// SDF mask and rim falloff land in task 5.1, and the surface's contrast
// damping and grain attenuation land in task 7.1. This exists only to give
// task 4.7's pipeline verification a valid `composite()` to concatenate
// against, in both compositor positions, until those real compositors
// exist.
//
// Written once in the portable subset (see docs/shader-abi.md).

vec4 composite(vec2 p, float t, float energy, float coherence, float warmth, float pulse) {
    vec3 color = field(p, t, energy, coherence, warmth, pulse);
    return vec4(color, 1.0);
}
